# The web app needs nothing. It has no accounts, makes no requests, and reads
# its catalogue from machine/catalog/**/*.md at build time.
#
# Everything below configures the Edge Functions, which are deployed and
# scheduled independently of the site.

# Edge Function secrets are configured with `supabase secrets set`, never in Vite.
# APP_URLS=https://hub-william.site,http://localhost:5173
# Encrypts stored ChatGPT authorizations. Losing it makes every connected
# account undecryptable, so back it up before deploying.
# PROVIDER_CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY=base64-encoded-32-byte-key
# Shared secret for the scheduled quota refresh (x-sync-secret header).
# PROVIDER_SYNC_SECRET=random-scheduler-secret
# Optional broad Vietnam job-search source. Public ATS and remote-job sources
# still synchronize when this secret is absent.
# JOOBLE_API_KEY=your-jooble-api-key
# Summarization. Optional as a whole: without SUMMARY_API_KEY, news-summarize
# still collects the coverage and leaves the writing to the admin editor.
#
# The provider is a secret rather than a deployment. Groq, OpenRouter, DeepSeek
# and Together all speak the OpenAI chat-completions shape, and so does Claude
# through OpenRouter, so moving between them is three values here and no code
# change. Never a consumer subscription token — only an API key.
#
# Defaults are Groq's free tier, which needs no card:
#   base  https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#   model openai/gpt-oss-120b
# SUMMARY_API_KEY=gsk_your-groq-api-key
# SUMMARY_API_BASE=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# SUMMARY_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
#
# Reasoning models bill their private thinking to the same completion budget as
# the answer — measured on gpt-oss-120b, the same summary cost 172 output tokens
# at "low" against 647 at "medium". Set to "none" for a provider that rejects
# the field entirely.
# SUMMARY_REASONING=low
#
# Alternatives that work with the same three values:
#   OpenRouter  base https://openrouter.ai/api/v1   model z-ai/glm-5.2:free
#   Claude      base https://openrouter.ai/api/v1   model anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5
